d", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked, and there's nothing duplicated:\n\n- **Flight R0001:** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. The $199 flight had a stop, so I skipped it.\n- **Hotel R0002:** Midtown Lodge (H1), checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so no manager approval was needed.\n\nI couldn't book both together as you preferred. My combined booking request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had been booked but the hotel hadn't. Rather than send the combined request again and risk paying for the flight twice, I booked the hotel on its own. Dana's reservations now show exactly one confirmed flight and one confirmed hotel.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01AUDRNcUnnSVBne9jNpxgeY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01D1117QdhvWNMssQr7KW9PS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under $1000 threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01G6u8wHpeTqz25L2kn9d738", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-sfo-jfk-20261112-F100-H1"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_019u9FMCyL7oskSUfwbTZBQS", "caller":